up: preds entry, upb; succs upb, turn
upb: preds up; succs up
turn: preds up; succs down
down: preds turn, downb; succs downb, out
downb: preds down; succs down
out: preds down; succs -
$ dom loops.ir two_phase
entry: idom -; df -
up: idom entry; df up
turn: idom up; df -
down: idom turn; df down
out: idom down; df -
downb: idom down; df down
upb: idom up; df up
